DECL	{"args":[{"name":"a","sort":{"sort":"track"}}],"body":{"rises":{"and":[{"and":[{"cmp":"le","lhs":{"args":[{"var":"a"}],"params":[{"param":"window"}],"quantity":"prim_heading_change"},"rhs":{"neg":{"param":"turn_min"}}},{"cmp":"gt","lhs":{"args":[{"var":"a"}],"params":[{"param":"window"}],"quantity":"prim_heading_change"},"rhs":{"neg":{"param":"u_turn_min"}}}]},{"cmp":"le","lhs":{"abs":{"args":[{"var":"a"}],"measure":"kin_yaw_rate"}},"rhs":{"param":"yaw_tol"}}]}},"contract":"Road user a has completed a turn to the right. Its heading change over the window behind the observation (prim.heading_change over a window of length window, degrees, positive to the left) lies in the band from minus u_turn_min exclusive to minus turn_min inclusive: a turn to the right by at least turn_min and by less than u_turn_min, so that a heading change too small to be a turn and a reversal of direction both lie outside it. The act begins within the window behind the observation at which it is recognized. The act is recognized at the observation at which the heading change over the window behind lies in that band and a's yaw rate (kin.yaw_rate) is at most yaw_tol in magnitude, where this did not hold at the previous observation: the heading has stopped turning. The concept holds at that observation only, and not again until that condition has ceased to hold and then holds again. Conduct before the window behind is not read: a turn that takes longer than the window is not recognized. It denotes the change of a's heading only: it says nothing of the lane, the intersection or the way on which a turns, of its speed, or of why it turns. Not denoted: a heading change to the right smaller than turn_min, such as a lane change or a drift; a heading change of u_turn_min or more, which is a reversal of direction; a turn to the left; a turn still under way, whose yaw rate exceeds yaw_tol. Where the window is truncated or a yaw rate in it is missing, it is unknown.","definition":null,"id":"drv.motion.right_turn","kind":"formula","narrowings":[],"params":[{"name":"window","unit":"second"},{"name":"turn_min","unit":"degree"},{"name":"u_turn_min","unit":"degree"},{"name":"yaw_tol","unit":"degree_per_second"}],"residues":[],"supersedes":null}
